	(text "TPS1H200AQDGNRQ1 Config.\n\nFAULT pin: diagnostic tool? just leave floating to a touch point\nDIAG_EN pin: controls load with stuff like overcurrent, thermal protections, etc.?\nCL pin: current limit. Connect right to ground if un-used. Else, use resistor before connection to ground.\n    R_CL = (V_CL * K_CL) / I_out, V_CL = 0.8, K_CL = 2500\n    R_CL = (0.8 * 2500) / 0.5 = 4000 [Ohm]\nDELAY = set to auto-retry mode (connect w/ 100kOhm resistor to VS\nIN = controls output? Set to same as VS since we aren't controlling via microcontroller"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.494 121.158 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "67689525-bdd4-445d-9b6e-69ed4e5d32a5")
	)
